THE PROCESS
How It Works
Getting started is simple. Here's exactly what to expect from day one to your first session and beyond.
01 
Free Consultation
We start with a no-obligation conversation — in person or online. Tell us where you're at, what you're struggling with, and what you want to achieve. We listen first.
02 
Your Personal Plan
Based on your goals, fitness level, schedule, and lifestyle, we design a completely bespoke training programme. Nothing generic.
03 
First Session
We hit the ground running. Your first session is about learning your body, establishing techniques, and building your confidence in the training environment.
04 
Progress & Evolve
Every 4 weeks, we review your progress, celebrate your wins, and update your plan. Your training grows with you — always challenging, never overwhelming.
