GOT QUESTIONS?
Frequently Asked
↗ 
Do I need any fitness experience to start?
Absolutely not. EMANUWELL is designed for all starting points — complete beginners are just as welcome as those with some experience. We tailor everything to where you are right now.
↗ 
Where do sessions take place?
Sessions can take place in a local gym facility, outdoors, or online via video call depending on your preference and package. We'll agree to the best option during your free consultation.
↗ 
How many sessions a week will I need?
That depends on your goals and availability, but most clients start with 1 sessions per week. We'll build a schedule that's challenging but sustainable for your lifestyle.
↗ 
What does the online coaching package include?
Online coaching includes a fully customised training programme, weekly check-in calls, nutritional guidance, and programme updates every 4 weeks.
↗ 
Is EMANUWELL affordable for students?
We believe cost shouldn't be a barrier to good health. We offer student-friendly pricing and flexible payment options. Get in touch and we'll find a package that works for your budget.
↗ 
What if I have an injury or health condition?
We take health and safety seriously. During your consultation, we'll discuss any injuries or conditions and design a programme that works with your body, not against it. We always recommend GP clearance if needed.
